      "date": "2026-08-25 13:03:03.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(4 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nMostly good, minor comments inline. The fix itself looks right: lnet_discover() clears LNET_PEER_NIDS_UPTODATE and blocks until the state machine finishes, so the second discover does pick up the NI that lnet_dyn_add_ni() published on the remote, and lnet_peer_merge_data() skips the lolnd entry so the counted NIs do line up with ${RNIDS[@]}.",
