          "date": "2026-08-25 02:09:14.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-20596 tests: discover peer after the NI add",
        "message": "LU-20596 tests: discover peer after the NI add\n\nsetup_health_test() discovers the remote peer before it adds a second\nNI to that peer. The local peer record then holds one NI.\n\nlnet_health_check() sets attempt_remote_resend to false when the peer\nholds one NI. LNet then does not resend the message. The first\nremote_* ping of test_233 fails with -EIO and no resend.\n\nDiscover the peer again after the code adds the NIs. Check that the\nlocal peer record holds all remote NIs.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5\nChange-Id: Ib4c4ae0a4f962149e09a652fac6ea5a9f4838382\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
